Z||000000||Slick781||12-24-2000||02:13 AM||||Well, I'm just lookin around at some kits, and got to wondering how they are made.  What knowledge is needed to actually make the pieces?  And what is actually used to make them?  Anybody know of any websites?<P>David||||reg||5
