Z||000002||Formula||12-24-2000||12:32 PM||||I sometimes come across some interesting articles in kit car magazine that deal with this topic.<P>from my understanding (which may be wrong) you make a "mold" out of styrofoam or wood or something, then you use fiberglass in the mold and make the part.  I'm sure there is a lot better explanation then this but that might help get you started.||||reg||1
