Z||000008||rockcrawl||12-24-2000||06:23 PM||||How 'bout something like this??<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/ss2_1.jpg"> <BR>These are the ones I designed and made a few sets of. I still have the molds and hardware, which will be for sale as soon as I have time to get everything organized. I just have too much to do, no time to make them. If you've got time, you can make a huge profit.<P>And to help answer your original question, it takes a huge amount of time and skill to create molds for a complete body kit. It's not worthwhile unless you are going to market them. <P>------------------<BR>Jon Lagler<BR>'87 GT<BR>4.9 liter V8 Testarossa Spyder (under construction)<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/rockcrawlsig.jpg"> ||||reg||1
